lines:
Er-hem! I am the Chairman of the
Pokémon Fan Club!{be01}
Being the Chairman, I am naturally
the most important!{be01}
No one could best me when it comes
to raising Pokémon. No one!{be01}
In any Contest, my victory is a
foregone conclusion!{be01}
But, that would deprive others of
their enjoyment.{be01}
So, I now while away my time
examining the Pokémon of others.{be01}
It is marvelous to witness how
others have raised Pokémon.{be01}
The contented faces of properly
raised Pokémon...{be01}
The kind and loving gazes of their
Trainers...{be01}
My heart is overwhelmed - there is
so much happiness.{be01}
Oh, my! Excuse me! I seem to have
nattered on far too long!{be01}
Please, do allow me to examine your
Pokémon and see how it’s grown.

Hmmm... It’s not bad, but it’s not
good, either...{be01}
You, the Trainer, must put more
effort into raising this Pokémon!{be01}
For instance, may I suggest that
you give it more Pokéblocks?

Oh, my...{be01}
Your Pokémon is growing quite well,
so you deserve a reward.{be01}
Unfortunately, you have no space for
this in your Bag.

我喜欢看到爱它们的训练家的宝可
梦。宝可梦对训练家的感情非常敏{be01}
感，如果你用爱与细心照料你的宝可
梦，它们也会回报你的爱。当你的宝{be01}
可梦开始喜欢你了，就来给我看看
吧。

Okay, that makes sense.{be01}
The next question might be a little
on the tough side.{be01}
Here goes...{be01}
What do Pokémon mean to you?

Hi, you seem to be very close to your
{0100:1}.{be01}
Do you know what?
I’m a TV reporter.{be01}
I travel around interviewing people
about Pokémon.{be01}
I’m wondering if you’d be willing to tell
me a little abut your {0100:1}?

Wow...
That’s an interesting account.{be01}
You really are tight with {0100:1},
aren’t you?{be01}
I get the feeling that your account
will make a great TV story.{be01}
I promise that I’ll turn this into
an entertaining show.{be00}
Keep your eyes out for it.{be01}
Okay, that’s all.
Bye-bye!
